sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Host spot
    participant S as messagingCtaLogic
    participant F as PostHog analytics
    participant D as Before you send
    participant E as Editor
    H->>S: person clicks
    S->>H: audience()
    alt audience fails
        H-->>S: error, such as the flag cohort failing to calculate
        S->>F: capture messaging cta failed {placement, attemptId, stage: audience}
        S-->>H: error toast with Try again, person stays on the page
    else audience resolves
        S->>D: checks: suspension, senders, test sender, cohorts
        alt a check fails or takes over 5 s
            D-->>S: stays quiet, the editor checks again
        else no verified sender, test sender usable
            D-->>S: test-only note: Continue or Set up email
        else sending suspended
            D-->>S: blocker note: Continue or Cancel
        end
        alt person left the page while checks ran
            S-->>S: stop, no navigation
        else
            S->>E: open with source and attempt
        end
    end
